  "Diagnostic fee: <strong>$89</strong> — waived with repair. Written estimate before we start. <strong>90-day warranty</strong>. Weekends available. <em>Salt air tip for Huntington Beach: If your refrigerator is running louder or cycling more frequently than it used to — and you're in a Huntington Harbour home, canal-front property, or near the Pier — salt-loaded condenser coils are almost certainly the cause. Clean every 4–6 months in a coastal property. We include this inspection on every HB refrigerator call.</em>"
